               "body" : {
                  "content" : [
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Probably simplest way to fix is to use telldir and just scan til we get same telldir().",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "Only trick is that for Equals()  to work - we sort of need to know the PREVIOUS telldir. So maybe store that JUST so equals can work (not one param is const so cannot just move it along).",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     },
                     {
                        "content" : [
                           {
                              "text" : "JUST FOR MACOS - this is needed, but maybe rewrite for posix since my plan is a little simpler I think - than what I have no (except for the extra telldir being saved for equals - but I may find a way around that",
                              "type" : "text"
                           }
                        ],
                        "type" : "paragraph"
                     }
                  ],
